<title>USA: Cross to buy Permian Basin properties.</title>
<headline>Cross to buy Permian Basin properties.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cross Timbers Oil Co said Tuesday it entered into an agreement to acquire oil and gas producing properties in the Permian Basin of West Texas for $27.5 million.</p>
<p>The company said the interests are owned by various limited partnerships formed by New York Life Insurance Co and American Exploration Co.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close December 1 and will be funded by bank lines of credit, a statement from Cross Timbers said.</p>
</text>
